{"id":"73b611f2b292e511","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-rpreserving-char.md","title":"随机性保持的零集拉回刻画","display":"thm-rpreserving-char — 随机性保持的零集拉回刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-rpreserving-char","aliases":["43-thm-rpreserving-char"],"display":"thm-rpreserving-char — 随机性保持的零集拉回刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-rpreserving]]","[[43-df-mltest]]","[[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-rpreserving-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-rpreserving-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rpreserving-char — 随机性保持的零集拉回刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47114eccf2042715\" href=\"?note=47114eccf2042715\" title=\"43-df-rpreserving\">43-df-rpreserving</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d602113af79aa36d\" href=\"?note=d602113af79aa36d\" title=\"43-thm-ml-universal-test\">43-thm-ml-universal-test</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\">\\(\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPreserving}\">\\(\\operatorname{RPreserving}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLTest}\">\\(\\operatorname{MLTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"47114eccf2042715\" href=\"?note=47114eccf2042715\" title=\"43-df-rpreserving\">43-df-rpreserving</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>。U与V遍历开集序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLTest}(V)\\land\\Phi^{-1}\\!\\left[\\bigcap_nU_n\\right]\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLTest}(V)\\land\\Phi^{-1}\\!\\left[\\bigcap_nU_n\\right]\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：保持随机性意味着任何零集拉回中的点都非随机，故由固定通用检验覆盖；反向若Φ(X)失败某检验，拉回覆盖迫使X也失败。这里V的存在不要求从U有效求出，因此任意映射都适用。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-rpreserving","status":"resolved","id":"47114eccf2042715","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rpreserving]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-universal-test","status":"resolved","id":"d602113af79aa36d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-universal-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rpreserving","status":"resolved","id":"47114eccf2042715","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{RPreserving}$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-rpreserving]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。U与V遍历开集序列。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{RPreserving}$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-rpreserving]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。U与V遍历开集序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RPreserving}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi)\\iff\\forall U\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLTest}(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLTest}(V)\\land\\Phi^{-1}\\!\\left[\\bigcap_nU_n\\right]\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1450,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-rpreserving-char]] — 随机性保持的零集拉回刻画"}],"outgoing":["47114eccf2042715","e738767b1d98289f","d602113af79aa36d"]}